Bundled data
------------
The seed materials data under src/quantum_foundry/materials/sources/seed_data/
includes values derived from the following datasets, each licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/):

  * JARVIS-DFT "dft_2d" dataset, National Institute of Standards and
    Technology (figshare article 6815705).
    K. Choudhary et al., npj Computational Materials 6, 173 (2020).
  * Computational 2D Materials Database (C2DB), Technical University of
    Denmark. S. Haastrup et al., 2D Materials 5, 042002 (2018);
    M. N. Gjerding et al., 2D Materials 8, 044002 (2021).
  * The Materials Project. A. Jain et al., APL Materials 1, 011002 (2013).

Values taken from individual published papers carry their own per-field
citation inside each seed-data file.

Optional external tools
-----------------------
Quantum Foundry can drive several separately-installed scientific tools.
None of them is bundled with or linked into this package; GPL-licensed tools
(gmsh, Elmer, Quantum ESPRESSO) are only ever run as separate processes or
containers. See THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md for the full list and their licenses.
